{"id":2,"path":"/","parentId":null,"order":0,"section":null,"level":null,"depth":0,"title":"✓ Home Page","seo":{"title":"Test your English - Every level and every skill","description":"Free English lessons at Test-English.com: grammar, vocabulary, listening, reading. Learn English online for free with tests and exam prep.","image":"/media/uploads/Home-page-featured-scaled.webp"},"modified":"2025-02-27T09:14:05","kind":"home","html":"<h2 class=\"home-h2\">What would you like to<span> learn</span> today?</h2> <section id=\"h-cta\" class=\"flex one center maxW1400\"> <div id=\"home-cat-items\" class=\"flex one two-600 three-800\"> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"Notebook and keyboard on desk for English grammar lessons and exercises\" src=\"/media/img/test-english-home-Grammar-points.jpg\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title\"><span>Grammar Lessons</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\">Study the grammar lessons that are typically included in each level: <a href=\"/grammar-points/a1/\">A1</a>, <a href=\"/grammar-points/a2\">A2</a>, <a href=\"/grammar-points/b1\">B1</a>, <a href=\"/grammar-points/b1-b2/\">B1+</a>, <a href=\"/grammar-points/b2/\">B2</a>. There are three or more exercises and an explanation in each lesson, and feedback for every single question!</p> <a href=\"/\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Go to the lessons</a> </div></div></div> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"Magnifying glass over letter tiles for English vocabulary learning and word practice\" src=\"/media/img/test-english-home-Vocabulary.jpg\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title\"><span>Vocabulary Lessons</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\">Boost your vocabulary with exercises tailored for each level: <a href=\"/vocabulary/a1/\"> A1</a>, <a href=\"/vocabulary/a2/\"> A2</a>, <a href=\"/vocabulary/b1/\"> B1</a>, <a href=\"/vocabulary/b1-b2/\"> B1+</a>, <a href=\"/vocabulary/b2/\"> B2</a>. Every lesson features keywords, definitions, pictures and quizzes with personalized feedback to enhance your learning.</p> <a href=\"/vocabulary\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Go to the lessons</a> </div></div></div> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"Earphones on yellow background for English listening practice and audio tests\" src=\"/media/img/test-english-home-Listening.jpg\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title \"><span>Listening Tests</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\">Improve your listening skills by practicing with our video tests. There are tests for each level: <a href=\"/listening/a1/\">A1</a>, <a href=\"/listening/a2\">A2</a>, <a href=\"//listening/b1\">B1</a>, <a href=\"/listening/b1-b2\">B1+</a>, <a href=\"/listening/b2\">B2</a>. You will be able to see the transcription of the audio after you submit your answers.</p> <a href=\"/\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Go to the tests</a> </div></div></div> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"Stack of books with open book for English reading comprehension practice\" src=\"/media/img/test-english-home-Reading.jpg\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title \"><span>Reading Tests</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\">Need to improve your reading skills? Work on our reading tests. There are reading tests for <a href=\"/reading/a1/\">A1</a>, <a href=\"/reading/a2/\">A2</a>, <a href=\"/reading/b1\">B1</a>, <a href=\"/reading/b1-b2/\">B1+</a> and <a href=\"/reading/b2/\">B2</a>. You will find different types of texts and there are different types of questions in each test.</p> <a href=\"/\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Go to the tests</a> </div></div></div> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"Laptop with notebook and coffee for Use of English grammar and vocabulary tests\" src=\"/media/img/test-english-home-Use-of-english.jpg\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title \"><span>Use of English Tests</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\">In each of these tests you will find 15 multiple-choice questions about the different <a href=\"/grammar-points/\">grammar lessons</a> that you have studied for a specific level: <a href=\"/use-of-english/a1/\">A1</a>, <a href=\"/use-of-english/a2/\">A2</a>, <a href=\"/use-of-english/b1/\">B1</a>, <a href=\"/use-of-english/b1-b2/\">B1+</a> and <a href=\"/use-of-english/b2/\">B2</a>.&nbsp; You will get feedback for every answer.</p> <a href=\"/\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Go to the tests</a> </div></div></div> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"Person writing in notebook for English writing lessons and exam preparation\" src=\"/media/img/test-english-home-Writing.jpg\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title \"><span>Writing Lessons</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\">Improve your writing with the exercises suggested in each lesson. Different types of texts for each level: <a href=\"/writing/a1/\">A1</a>, <a href=\"/writing/a2/\">A2</a>, <a href=\"/writing/b1/\">B1</a>, <a href=\"/writing/b1-b2/\">B1+</a>, or <a href=\"/writing/b2/\">B2</a>. You will learn how to organise and connect the text in your compositions.</p> <a href=\"/\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Go to the lessons</a> </div></div></div> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"English exam answer sheet with glasses and pencil for exam preparation practice\" src=\"/media/img/original.test-english-home-exams.jpg\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title \"><span>Exams</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\">Improve your exam skills and achieve better results with our practice materials. Test-English will help you with your Cambridge KEY, Cambridge Preliminary, Cambridge First, IELTS, or TOEFL iBT exam.</p> <a href=\"/exams\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Go to the exams</a> </div></div></div> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"Bar chart graphic representing English level placement test\" src=\"/media/img/test-english-home-Level-test.jpg\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title \"><span>Level Test</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\">If you are not sure about your level, don't worry, you can take this online test. There are 60 multiple-choice questions and there is no time limit. You will be able to see the answers when you finish the test.</p> <a href=\"/\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Take a level test</a> </div></div></div> <div class=\"home-cat-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable \"> <picture> <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"433\" height=\"240\" class=\"pill-img-top\" alt=\"Woman checking email on tablet for Test-English newsletter with new lessons and tests\" src=\"/media/img/test-english-home-Newsletter.webp\"> </picture> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h4 class=\"pill-title \"><span>New tests every week</span></h4> <p class=\"pill-text\"> Subscribe to our newsletter and get two new lessons every week straight to your inbox. Stay updated with the latest tests, discover new features and receive news about special content and site improvements.</p> <a href=\"/newsletter\" class=\"btn-cta ripple\">Join the newsletter</a> </div></div></div> </div> </section> <section id=\"h-recent-tests\" class=\"flex one center\"> <h3 class=\"home-h3\">Check our latest<span> lessons</span> and<span> tests</span>!</h3> <div class=\"flex center two three-800 six-900\"> <div class=\"recent-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable\"> <a href=\"/listening/c1/the-man-who-won-14-lotteries-c1-english-listening-test/\"> <img width=\"154\" height=\"86\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"/media/uploads/C1-Listening_the-man-who-won-14-lotteries-300x169.webp\" title=\"The man who won 14 lotteries – C1 English Listening Test\" alt=\"Lottery organiser holding a ticket among thousands of entries for a C1 English listening test\"> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h5 class=\"pill-title home-pill\">The man who won 14 lotteries – C1 English Listening Test</h5> </div> </a> </div> </div><div class=\"recent-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable\"> <a href=\"/reading/c1/the-plague-that-killed-100000-londoners-c1-english-reading-test/\"> <img width=\"154\" height=\"86\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"/media/uploads/The-plague-that-killed-100000-londoners_C1-reading-test-300x167.webp\" title=\"The plague that killed 100,000 Londoners – C1 Reading Test\" alt=\"Great Plague of London street scene with marked houses and a covered cart for a C1 English reading test.\"> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h5 class=\"pill-title home-pill\">The plague that killed 100,000 Londoners – C1 Reading Test</h5> </div> </a> </div> </div><div class=\"recent-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable\"> <a href=\"/grammar-points/c1/subject-verb-agreement-advanced-rules/\"> <img width=\"154\" height=\"86\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"/media/uploads/Subject%E2%80%93verb-agreement-C1%E2%80%93Grammar-300x167.webp\" title=\"Subject–verb agreement: Advanced rules\" alt=\"Cartoon characters handling complaints in an office for a C1 grammar lesson on subject-verb agreement.\"> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h5 class=\"pill-title home-pill\">Subject–verb agreement: Advanced rules</h5> </div> </a> </div> </div><div class=\"recent-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable\"> <a href=\"/vocabulary/c1/numbers-statistics-and-trends-c1-english-vocabulary/\"> <img width=\"154\" height=\"86\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"/media/uploads/C1-English-Vocabulary_Numbers-statistics-and-trends-300x169.webp\" title=\"Numbers, statistics and trends – C1 English Vocabulary\" alt=\"Laptop surrounded by charts and graphs for a C1 advanced vocabulary lesson on numbers, statistics and trends.\"> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h5 class=\"pill-title home-pill\">Numbers, statistics and trends – C1 English Vocabulary</h5> </div> </a> </div> </div><div class=\"recent-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable\"> <a href=\"/writing/c1/how-to-write-a-blog-post-c1-english-writing/\"> <img width=\"154\" height=\"86\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"/media/uploads/C1%E2%80%93Writing_How-to-write-a-C1-blog-post-300x167.webp\" title=\"How to write a blog post – C1 English writing\" alt=\"Woman writing a blog post on a laptop for a C1 English writing lesson.\"> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h5 class=\"pill-title home-pill\">How to write a blog post – C1 English writing</h5> </div> </a> </div> </div><div class=\"recent-item\"> <div class=\"pill border-r hoverable\"> <a href=\"/listening/c1/operation-cat-drop-c1-english-listening-test/\"> <img width=\"154\" height=\"86\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"/media/uploads/C1-Listening_Operation-cat-drop-300x169.webp\" title=\"Operation cat drop – C1 English Listening Test\" alt=\"Cats descending in parachute crates over Borneo during Operation Cat Drop – C1 advanced English listening test\"> <div class=\"pill-body\"> <h5 class=\"pill-title home-pill\">Operation cat drop – C1 English Listening Test</h5> </div> </a> </div> </div></div> </section>","quizzes":[]}